課程概述:
本課程主要介紹循環經濟之理論與實務，內容涵蓋循環經濟的學理基礎與重點議題、循環經濟衡量指標、產業落實循環經濟之做法、循環經濟創新商業模式等四大構面。透過本課程內容講授與個案研究計畫之訓練，期使學生能了解當前循環經濟的發展現況與未來趨勢，並能將所學知識，應用於分析當前循環經濟實踐之關鍵議題。
This course is designed to provide students with an understanding of both the theory and practice of the circular economy, as well as its role in sustainable development. The content is divided into four parts: theoretical foundations and key principles of the circular economy; measurement indicators for the circular economy, industry practices for implementing circular economy principles; and innovative business models for the circular economy. The course will examine the ways through which circular economy can contribute to achieving sustainable development goals, such as environmental protection, economic growth, and social equity. Through lectures and case studies in this class, students will gain the ability to:
1.	Understand the principles of circular economy and its roles in sustainable development; 
2.	Analyze the environmental, economic, and social benefits of circular economy; 
3.	Evaluate the challenges and opportunities of implementing circular economy practices in different sectors; 
4.	Apply circular economy concepts to real-world problems and develop solutions for sustainable    development.

