課程要求:
Students are required to choose one seminar paper and write a report on it. The report should consist of at least 3 parts:
i. paper summary;
ii. literature review;
iii. comments.

For example, based on the paper summary and literature review, students may comment on what the paper could contribute to the literature. Besides these 3 parts, the report may include discussions on the related papers, books, and literature. The report should be at least 4 pages long. Please do not commit plagiarism.

